{
  "_comment": [
    "Implementations audited with --audit-harness. Two kinds of row:",
    "go: one of Crucible's own harnesses (github.com/symbolicsoft/crucible), built",
    "unmodified from a pinned commit; the library behind it is pinned by the",
    "harness's go.sum, not hashed by pq-verify.",
    "java: one of pq-verify's own harnesses (pq_verify/harness/...), run against a",
    "library jar pinned by URL and sha256 (and the sources jar its mutants are",
    "rebuilt from). signed_by records the PGP key that signed both on Maven Central",
    "when they were pinned.",
    "Only Crucible's wire protocol is used: every check is pq-verify's (NIST ACVP,",
    "Wycheproof, CCTV), scored by pq-verify. tools/harness_audit.py rebuilds each",
    "harness and fails if a result differs or a mutant is not caught, so a failure",
    "means pq-verify changed (or a pinned toolchain or module did)."
  ],
